WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.808
OBSERVE. A whole bean plant with roots, stem, leaves and flower is displayed.

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:08.710
LABEL. Point to roots beneath the soil and stem above it.

00:00:09.617 --> 00:00:12.795
TRACE. Show water moving from roots up the stem to leaves.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:17.115
MATCH. Label leaves and flowers, then sketch the complete plant.
